cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite both the software/data record and the paper."
title: "cliff-cp: coverage failure of conformal prediction on activity cliffs"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and per-molecule records accompanying the manuscript
  "How the coverage guarantee of conformal prediction fails on activity cliffs:
  mechanism, diagnosis, and a structural blind spot of applicability domains".
  It quantifies, over 15 ChEMBL targets from the MoleculeACE benchmark,
  the cliff-versus-non-cliff coverage gap, an exact coverage-transfer identity,
  a label-free pre-deployment diagnostic for harmful partition signals,
  and the structural blindness of applicability-domain filters.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"

